### 1. 가짜 DB 사용자 저장
PUT http://localhost:8080/strategy/db/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 100,
  "name": "홍길동",
  "email": "hong@test.com",
  "age": 30
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/strategy/db/user?userId=100
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Cache Aside
GET http://localhost:8080/strategy/cache-aside/user?userId=100
Content-Type: application/json

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/strategy/cache-aside/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 100,
  "name": "홍길동-수정",
  "email": "hong-updated@test.com",
  "age": 31
}

### 3. Write Through
PUT http://localhost:8080/strategy/write-through/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 101,
  "name": "김철수",
  "email": "kim@test.com",
  "age": 28
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/strategy/write-through/user?userId=101
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Read Through
GET http://localhost:8080/strategy/read-through/user?userId=102
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Write Behind
PUT http://localhost:8080/strategy/write-behind/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 103,
  "name": "이영희",
  "email": "lee@test.com",
  "age": 26
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/strategy/write-behind/process-next
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. PER
GET http://localhost:8080/strategy/per/user?userId=100
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Lock
GET http://localhost:8080/strategy/lock/user?userId=104
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Background Refresh
POST http://localhost:8080/strategy/background-refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [100, 101, 102, 103, 104]
}

### 9. TTL 확인
GET http://localhost:8080/strategy/cache/value-with-ttl?key=strategy:user:100
Content-Type: application/json
